「趙亡則秦王王矣，武安君為三公。武安君所為秦戰勝攻取者七十餘城，南定鄢、郢、漢中，北禽趙括之軍，雖周、召、呂望之功不益於此矣。今趙亡，秦王王，則武安君必為三公，君能為之下乎？雖無欲為之下，固不得已矣。秦嘗攻韓，圍邢丘，困上黨，上黨之民皆反為趙，天下不樂為秦民之日久矣。今亡趙，北地入燕，東地入齊，南地入韓、魏，則君之所得民亡幾何人。故不如因而割之，無以為武安君功也。」於是應侯言於秦王曰：「秦兵勞，請許韓、趙之割地以和，且休士卒。」王聽之，割韓垣雍、趙六城以和。正月，皆罷兵。武安君聞之，由是與應侯有隙。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"王龁","kind":"person","person_id":"0th_8iq_2q0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"司馬梗","kind":"person","person_id":"ckv_ev3_1vi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"蘇代","kind":"person","person_id":"7c7_u2o_px7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0047","start":47,"end":51,"surface":"秦相應侯","kind":"person","person_id":"5av_w6l_zea","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"武安君","kind":"person","person_id":"0xk_jpf_0xw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0058","start":58,"end":61,"surface":"馬服子","kind":"person","person_id":"l9s_24a_7a3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"935_1k9_x7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0096","start":96,"end":99,"surface":"武安君","kind":"person","person_id":"0xk_jpf_0xw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"武安君","kind":"person","person_id":"0xk_jpf_0xw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"趙括","kind":"person","person_id":"l9s_24a_7a3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m006-0136","start":136,"end":137,"surface":"周","kind":"person","person_id":"ile_1tb_ymg","status":"contextual_provis